# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Submission repo: heavy artefacts are deliberately kept out so the tree stays
# clonable. Everything below still exists in the working repository and in the
# mirror backup; nothing was deleted to produce this copy.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Rendered video and raw production B-roll
*.mp4
*.mov
*.wav
assets/video_sources/
docs/media/video/

# Large trained models. Regenerate with: cd ai_service && python train.py
*.pkl
# Cloud Model/cloud_advisor_model.joblib is small and committed on purpose,
# so the pathology advisor runs without a training step.
*.joblib
!Cloud Model/cloud_advisor_model.joblib

# Ansys workbench binaries. Curated result images are kept in
# simulations/screenshots_for_judges/
*.mechdb
simulations/*workbench_files/

# Duplicate copies of the same eleven simulation figures
all_ansys_simulation_images/
ANSYS SIMULATIONS/
generated images simulation/

# Multi-megabyte stock research photography
docs/media/research/
